{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13280","headline":"和朝郎中扬子翫雪寄山阴严维 · 皇甫冉","name":"和朝郎中扬子翫雪寄山阴严维","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凝阴晦长箔，积雪满通川。\n征客寒犹去，愁人昼更眠。\n谢家兴咏日，汉将出师年。\n闻有招寻兴，随君访戴船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13280.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13280","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}